    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Somewhere in Britain right now, someone is unwrapping a generic lavender reed diffuser or a forgettable M&S voucher and practicing their best polite 'oh, you shouldn't have' face. We have all been there. Finding a truly great gift is hard work, and finding a great fragrance gift is notoriously tricky.</p><p>The common advice is to play it safe with generic crowd-pleasers. But playing it safe is how people end up with dressers full of boring scents they never wear. A great fragrance gift should feel personal, thoughtful, and just a little bit daring.</p>"
      }
    },
