    "blogtextliquid_ra7Awx": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>The secret to gifting fragrance is matching the scent to the recipient's personality archetype rather than guessing their favorite floral notes. Fragrance is an extension of how someone presents themselves to the world.</p><p>When you give a scent that reflects their energy, their aesthetic, and their personal style, it is not just a present—it is a compliment they get to wear every day. Here is our curated guide for every distinct character in your life.</p>"
      }
    },
    "blocks_ji7beH": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_614820f",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Quiet Luxury Minimalist vs The Bold Main Character",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_size_mobile": 28,
            "heading_line_height": 1.1,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_margin_bottom": 30,
            "heading_margin_bottom_mobile": 25,
            "column_1_text": "<p>For the friend who loves linen shirts, architectural ceramics, and neutral color palettes, avoid heavy, loud perfumes. They want understated excellence that feels clean, intentional, and expensive.</p><p>Our top recommendation is <strong>Marine</strong> (inspired by Bleu de Chanel) or <strong>Timeless Grace</strong> (inspired by Coco Mademoiselle). These scents sit close to the skin with crisp citrus, cedar, and airy musks, providing tailored elegance.</p>",
            "column_2_text": "<p>Then there is the friend with unmistakable main-character energy. They walk into a room with confidence, dress with flair, and want a signature scent that turns heads and commands attention.</p><p>For them, nothing less than <strong>Addiction</strong> (inspired by Baccarat Rouge 540) will do. The radiant saffron, ambergris, and sweet cedar trail is unforgettable and guarantees compliments everywhere they go.</p>",
            "body_size": 17,
            "body_size_mobile": 15,
            "body_line_height": 1.9,
            "body_color": "#2D2A26",
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "column_gap": 55,
            "column_gap_mobile": 30,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "padding_top": 60,
            "padding_bottom": 60,
            "padding_horizontal": 40,
            "padding_top_mobile": 40,
            "padding_bottom_mobile": 40,
            "padding_horizontal_mobile": 20
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_614820f_zNd6WG"
      ],
      "name": "Editorial text section",
      "settings": {}
    },
    "1778690749e24fd023": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_fb81b45",
          "settings": {
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
            "max_width": 1100,
            "section_padding": 60,
            "background_color": "#FAF8F5",
            "heading": "<p>The guy who irons his shirts for no reason: Fierce & Cool Alpine</p>",
            "heading_size": 42,
            "heading_color": "#1A1816",
            "heading_spacing": 25,
            "box_color": "#1C1917",
            "box_radius": 15,
            "box_padding": 45,
            "box_spacing": 35,
            "box_paragraph_1": "<p>Every family or friend group has this guy. He is organized, punctual, has his life together, and always smells effortlessly put together. He does not want a complicated fragrance project; he wants crisp, immaculate freshness.</p><p><strong>Fierce</strong> (inspired by Sauvage Parfum by Dior) delivers that magnetic bergamot and ambroxan punch that never fails.</p><p>If he prefers crisp mountain air, blackcurrant, and green tea freshness, <strong>Cool Alpine</strong> (inspired by Silver Mountain Water by Creed) is a cold drink of water in fragrance form.</p>",
            "box_paragraph_2": "",
            "box_paragraph_3": "",
            "box_text_color": "#F5EFE6",
            "box_text_size": 17,
            "box_text_line_height": 1.9,
            "paragraph_spacing": 20,
            "subheading": "<p>The friend who is impossible to shop for</p>",
            "subheading_size": 42,
            "subheading_color": "#1A1816",
            "subheading_spacing": 40,
            "bottom_text": "<p>For the person who already has everything, choose a scent with an intriguing twist: <strong>Mirage</strong> or <strong>Silk Odyssey</strong>. These scents avoid commercial clichés and offer rich, layered accords that surprise even seasoned collectors.</p><p>A discovery set of 3 travel bottles is another foolproof gift that lets them explore at their own pace.</p>",
            "bottom_text_size": 17,
            "bottom_text_color": "#2D2A26",
            "bottom_text_line_height": 1.9
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ai_gen_block_fb81b45_9nTtAA"
      ],
      "settings": {}
    },
